{"id":"steam-1029830","steam":1029830,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"CHIP: Rescuer of Kittens","summary":"CHIP is a 2D Metroidvania platformer in retro-style where you are a space rescuer of kittens. Explore The Universe in a shiny new spaceship. Travel from planet to planet, fight against an evil Dr.Meowcraft and robots, save the kidnapped kittens!","about":"Explore The Universe in a shiny new spaceship. Travel from planet to planet, fight against an evil Dr.Meowcraft and robots, save the kidnapped kittens! CHIP is a 2D Metroidvania platformer in retro-style where you are a space rescuer of kittens. Run, jump, climb, and shoot your way through high-tech cities, mysterious rocks, and majestic forest.\n\n \n\nKey Features\n\n• \n Explore the galaxy and travel between 5 planets aboard your trusty spaceship. \n• \n Secret locations await the most curious players.\r\n\n• \n Unlock new abilities, upgrade your blaster, and battle the evil robot army of Dr. Meowcraft.\r\n\n• \n Enjoy slick Game Boy-style pixel art in 320x180 resolution — old school has never looked this cool!\n• \nJump, run, climb, and dodge — every level is packed with traps, enemies, and unexpected twists!","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029830/d27f6ee249a9c02a518bcdf2bffab6d63b7cd488/library_capsule.jpg?t=1789250793","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029830/61a497cc12a28952ecc5dc8a14386f2905107725/header.jpg?t=1789250793","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029830/library_hero.jpg?t=1789250793","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029830/61a497cc12a28952ecc5dc8a14386f2905107725/header.jpg?t=1789250793","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029830/4d46dcdf1e5ce6b9e7548578651e42c1424308eb/ss_4d46dcdf1e5ce6b9e7548578651e42c1424308eb.600x338.jpg?t=1789250